1
00:00:00,524 --> 00:00:04,109
Sharma ji, likh lijiye... kal de dunga!

2
00:00:05,028 --> 00:00:06,116
Kal de dunga!

3
00:00:07,039 --> 00:00:09,420
Ye 'kal'... aata kab hai?

4
00:00:10,336 --> 00:00:14,604
340 ya 840? Maangoon kaise?

5
00:00:14,985 --> 00:00:17,742
Hisaab saaf ho, toh bura kaun maanega?

6
00:00:20,293 --> 00:00:22,208
Har grahak ki udhaar limit tay.

7
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,312
Kiska kitna baaki, ek nazar mein.

8
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,498
Aur kab se — 30, 60, 90 din!

9
00:00:33,508 --> 00:00:35,393
Likh lijiye, kal—

10
00:00:35,712 --> 00:00:38,793
Chacha ji, ₹340 — saat tareekh se.

11
00:00:39,814 --> 00:00:43,054
Arre waah! Paise aaj, chai kal!

12
00:00:44,742 --> 00:00:49,124
Udhaar ka hisaab, bina jhijhak. Nexcod POS.
